{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19989","headline":"寒溪 二 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳岸边道，孟氏庄前溪。\n舟行素冰折，声作青瑶嘶。\n绿水结绿玉，白波生白珪。\n明明宝镜中，物物天照齐。\n仄步下危曲，攀枯闻孀啼。\n霜芬稍消歇，凝景微茫齐。\n痴坐直视听，戆行失踪蹊。\n岸童斸棘劳，语言多悲凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}